  "solution": {
    "text": "According to equation of continuity,<br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⟹</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5&nbsp;</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
